    <p class="eyebrow">Redox signalling, explained simply</p>
    <h1 style="margin-top:14px">Your body is having billions of <em>conversations</em> right now.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I'm Sepp. I'm 61, a lifelong waterman and builder, and for 12 years I've been fascinated by how our cells talk to each other.</p>
    <p class="sub">This page shares what I've learned, in plain English. There's no pressure here. Read, explore the research, and if you'd like to talk, I'm happy to.</p>
